    "appearance": "Raymond is a gray office-cat fantasy — black tail, paws, and ears with pink insides, blonde hair combed neatly to the right, round glasses, and heterochromia with a green left eye and brown right. His house, catchphrase, and picture quote all wink at white-collar routine, a villager dressed for spreadsheets, espresso, and polished first impressions at the plaza.",
